cells that are faster, more efficient, and more flexible. At the same time, ongoing researchparticularly on the combination of classical optimal control with artificial intelligenceis poised to unlock even greater capabilities, making robot-as-a-service palletizing an increasingly attractive and reliable option for a wide range of end-of-line packaging needs.
